## Interface: 30300
## Title: Target Loot (Journal)
## Notes: A small button on your target showing what that creature drops, straight from your realm's loot tables through the mod-forever-journal server module. Drops from the creature itself are listed apart from shared world drops. Click the button (or /tloot) to open the loot list; hover an item for its tooltip, Shift-click to link it, Ctrl-click to preview it.
